module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.fixture_flattened_to_the_reader_grain_it_should_falsify

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data fixture_flattened_to_the_reader_grain_it_should_falsify: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "fixture_flattened_to_the_reader_grain_it_should_falsify" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "**a fixture is reshaped until it matches the reader's grain, and the accommodation is written up as fidelity to the producer** (INVALID STATE: a check is red because the reader under test cannot see the fixture's shape. ",

    "The author changes the FIXTURE, records why in a careful note asserting that the real producer emits the accommodated shape, and the check goes green -- so the reader's grain defect is now the check's specification and no future edit to the reader can make the check disagree. ",

    "HARM: it is worse than an absent check, because the note is persuasive and reads as diligence. ",

    "The one written here even names the empty-fixture failure it was avoiding. ",

    "MEASURED SPECIMEN (gunbc#10156, adjudicated by execution 2026-09-03). ",

    "`v2.std.fn_index` `call_reachable_decls` reads a declaration's callees from `decl.output` through `atom_identities_in_node`, which returns the node's own atom identity and those of its IMMEDIATE children. ",

    "`v2.test.claim.enforcement.determinism_transitive_witness` had first been authored with the callee atom one level deeper, nothing was reachable, and both of its discrimination rows agreed for that shared wrong cause. ",

    "The repair flattened the fixture and recorded the reason: THE FN-ARROW SKELETON IS FLAT, AND THE FIXTURE MUST BE TOO, because the Rust marshal hoists callee atoms onto the body root. ",

    "That premise is false. ",

    "`marshal_generic` emits EVERY node as a Conj record carrying its callee atom as a positional child, so a callee sits one level under the root only when the body IS that single call; a `let`-block body carries its callees two or more levels down. ",

    "Measured over the live corpus by `v2.lens.fn_index_depth_agreement`: of 1777 fn-arrow declarations, 877 had callees the depth-one reader could not see at all, and the depth-one reader returned 890 of 8908 subtree atom identities. ",

    "Every consumer of the cross-declaration walk -- `v2.lens.determinism`, `v2.lens.effect_reach`, `v2.lens.live_read_classification` -- was reaching only the declarations whose whole body is one call, and all their fixtures were flat, so all of them were green. ",

    "**THE TELL IS SPECIFIC AND MECHANICAL: A NOTE THAT JUSTIFIES THE FIXTURE'S SHAPE BY ASSERTING WHAT THE REAL PRODUCER EMITS, WITH NOTHING EXECUTED AGAINST THE REAL PRODUCER.** The fixture is where the producer is absent by construction, so a claim about the producer made inside a fixture file is unfalsifiable in the place it is written; it has to be decided against the live population or it is a story. ",

    "RUNG FOUND AT: outside the ladder -- the check executed, was gated on, and discriminated nothing about the grain it appeared to fix. ",

    "CEILING: 2, mechanically preventable, and the reason it is not 3 is that a fixture is authored data: no construction forbids authoring a shape narrower than the population, because a narrower shape is exactly what a MINIMAL fixture legitimately is. ",

    "NEXT TRIGGER, NAMED AS THE CAPABILITY: **a shape-conformance judgment that decides, by execution against the live producer, whether a fixture's node shapes are inhabited by the population the check claims to range over, and refuses a fixture whose shapes are disjoint from it** -- with a discriminating RED (a fixture whose body shape no live declaration exhibits, refused), an accepted positive control (a fixture shape the live corpus inhabits), and a control proving the judgment reads the producer rather than a second fixture. ",

    "Until it exists, the standing mitigation is the one applied here: when a fixture is reshaped to make a reader green, the reshape must land beside a row measured on the live population, and the fixture keeps a row at the UNACCOMMODATED shape.)",

  ],

  evidence: [],
}
